@RULE QuadLife

QuadLife: Life (B3/S23) in four colours, states 1 to 4. A survivor keeps its colour; a cell born
takes the colour most of its three parents have, or, when all three differ, the fourth colour.

From LifeWiki's Rule:QuadLife (https://conwaylife.com/wiki/Rule:QuadLife), last edited
20 December 2019. LifeWiki's content is available under the GNU Free Documentation License 1.2
(https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/fdl-1.2.html), and this file is distributed under those
terms, not ISC. It is LifeWiki's file unchanged except for this description; the link below
is the file's own, to the forum post it came from. Golly does not ship this rule.

https://conwaylife.com/forums/viewtopic.php?p=75821#p75824

